  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "[Documentation & Maintenance]\n      - README Revamp: Completely updated project documentation to reflect the Middleware-first architecture, providing clear guidelines on 'MiddlewareHandler' implementation and modern route configuration.\n      - Codebase Cleanup: Removed legacy placeholders and unused abstraction remnants from previous iterations to improve internal clarity and reduce project noise.\n      - Zero Impact: These changes are purely cosmetic and structural; no breaking changes introduced to the core architecture or existing Middleware/Route implementations.\n\n      [Stability]\n      - Enhanced Documentation: Added clear examples for direct Middleware inheritance and integration with 'RouteHandler'.\n      - Cleaned up internal namespaces to maintain strict project boundaries.\n\n      [Performance]\n      - Maintained hyper-efficient execution path established in 4.0.0.",
